#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid "Qué es, con precisión"
msgstr "What it is, precisely"

#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid "De grafito a grafeno: es cuestión de capas."
msgstr "From graphite to graphene: it is a matter of layers."

#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid ""
"La norma ISO/TS 80004-13 define el grafeno como una sola capa de átomos de "
"carbono<sup class=\"cite\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>. Entre tres y "
"diez capas se llama grafeno de pocas capas<sup class=\"cite\"><a "
"href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>; con muchas, es grafito. En los textiles es "
"habitual usar derivados como el óxido de grafeno, que no se comportan igual "
"que la lámina ideal<sup class=\"cite\"><a href=\"#ref-16\">[16]</a></sup>. "
"Saber qué forma lleva una prenda es la primera pregunta útil."
msgstr ""
"The ISO/TS 80004-13 standard defines graphene as a single layer of carbon "
"atoms<sup class=\"cite\"><a href=\"#ref-3\">[3]</a></sup>. Between three and"
" ten layers it is called few-layer graphene<sup class=\"cite\"><a "
"href=\"#ref-4\">[4]</a></sup>; with many, it is graphite. In textiles it is "
"common to use derivatives such as graphene oxide, which do not behave like "
"the ideal sheet<sup class=\"cite\"><a href=\"#ref-16\">[16]</a></sup>. "
"Knowing which form a garment contains is the first useful question."

#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid "Del grafito al grafeno"
msgstr "From graphite to graphene"

#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid ""
"Tres pilas de capas de carbono: grafito con muchas capas, grafeno de pocas "
"capas con tres a diez, y grafeno con una sola capa."
msgstr ""
"Three stacks of carbon layers: graphite with many layers, few-layer graphene"
" with three to ten, and graphene with a single layer."

#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid "Grafito"
msgstr "Graphite"

