#: gotogym/templates/static_pages/about.html
msgid ""
"La tela se trata con grafeno o con óxido de grafeno reducido. Es la vía de "
"los calefactores textiles y de varios sensores<sup class=\"cite\"><a "
"href=\"#ref-10\">[10]</a><a href=\"#ref-14\">[14]</a></sup>."
msgstr ""
"The fabric is treated with graphene or reduced graphene oxide. It is the "
